## since 2026-11-08, the Crater's quality pass: "Earth is the jewel", the brief). One small map drawn here from coarse
## outlines of the continents (a few dozen points each, in degrees of longitude and latitude, written for this from
## common geography: no map, picture or data file is read or copied), so Earth looks like itself from the Moon: Africa,
## the Americas, Eurasia, Australia, the ice caps. At the size Earth shows (a few degrees across) a pixel of the map is
## about a degree, so outlines good to a degree or two are enough; the shader breaks the coasts up with noise.
